    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Easily configure <strong>WooCommerce payment gateways per product</strong> with this versatile, flexible Payments plugin. Gain complete control over which payment options appear for individual products in your WooCommerce store. Set specific gateways such as PayPal, Stripe, or credit cards for each product, offering tailored checkout experiences for your customers.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Assign unique payment gateways to individual products.<br />\n&#8211; Display default gateways when no product-specific ones are set.<br />\n&#8211; Enhance customer experience with <strong>custom checkout flows</strong>.<br />\n&#8211; Fully compatible with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and optimized for performance.</p>\n<p>Unlock seamless checkout customization and deliver better shopping experiences with this must-have WooCommerce plugin.</p>\n<p><strong>Related Plugins by Dreamfox:</strong><br />\n&#8211; <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-shipping-gateway-per-product/\" rel=\"ugc\">WC Shipping Gateway per Product</a>: Manage shipping options for each product.<br />\n&#8211; <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-delivery-date/\" rel=\"ugc\">WooCommerce Delivery Date</a>: Schedule deliveries with ease.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h3>Automatic Installation:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New</strong> in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Search for <code>WooCommerce Payment Gateway Per Product</code>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Manual Installation:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP file via the WordPress admin or FTP.</li>\n<li>Extract and place it in the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20happens%20if%20i%20add%20products%20with%20different%20payment%20gateways%20to%20the%20cart%3F'>\nWhat happens if I add products with different payment gateways to the cart?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Allowed payment gateways are prioritized over denied gateways. For example:<br />\n&#8211; Product 1: PayPal<br />\n&#8211; Product 2: PayPal + Credit Card<br />\nBoth gateways will be available at checkout.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20does%20this%20plugin%20benefit%20my%20woocommerce%20store%3F'>\nHow does this plugin benefit my WooCommerce store?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin enables <strong>customized payment workflows</strong> for a tailored shopping experience, increasing conversion rates.</p>\n<p>For more details, visit <a href=\"http://www.dreamfoxmedia.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dreamfox Media</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>3.6.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update freemius SDK to 2.11.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security issues solved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security issues solved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n<li>Update Freemius SDK to 10.2</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.5.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&#8230; (keep existing changelog entries here) &#8230;</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Easily configure WooCommerce payment gateways for individual products, offering tailored checkout experiences.",
    "description": "<p>Easily configure <strong>WooCommerce payment gateways per product</strong> with this versatile, flexible Payments plugin. Gain complete control over which payment options appear for individual products in your WooCommerce store. Set specific gateways such as PayPal, Stripe, or credit cards for each product, offering tailored checkout experiences for your customers.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Assign unique payment gateways to individual products.<br />\n&#8211; Display default gateways when no product-specific ones are set.<br />\n&#8211; Enhance customer experience with <strong>custom checkout flows</strong>.<br />\n&#8211; Fully compatible with the latest WordPress and WooCommerce versions.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight and optimized for performance.</p>\n<p>Unlock seamless checkout customization and deliver better shopping experiences with this must-have WooCommerce plugin.</p>\n<p><strong>Related Plugins by Dreamfox:</strong><br />\n&#8211; <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-shipping-gateway-per-product/\" rel=\"ugc\">WC Shipping Gateway per Product</a>: Manage shipping options for each product.<br />\n&#8211; <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce-delivery-date/\" rel=\"ugc\">WooCommerce Delivery Date</a>: Schedule deliveries with ease.</p>\n",
